</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
      <div class="col-lg-7" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="800">
        <span class="kicker"><span class="pulse"></span>Available for new roles · Pune / Mumbai</span>
        <h1>Building <span id="typedTarget" class="grad-text"></span><span class="typed-cursor">&nbsp;</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">Senior Flutter Developer with 4+ years turning clean architecture into cross-platform mobile apps — Flutter on the front, Node.js &amp; PostgreSQL underneath.</p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="https://farmer-brand.vercel.app/resume" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-grad"><i class="bi bi-download me-2"></i>Download résumé</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn-glass">Let's talk</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stats glass">
          <div class="hero-stat"><b class="counter" data-target="4" data-suffix="+">0</b><span>Years exp.</span></div>
          <div class="hero-stat"><b class="counter" data-target="7">0</b><span>Shipped apps</span></div>
          <div class="hero-stat"><b class="counter" data-target="35" data-prefix="-" data-suffix="%">0</b><span>Load time</span></div>
          <div class="hero-stat"><b class="counter" data-target="50" data-prefix="-" data-suffix="%">0</b><span>Bug resolution</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-5" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="150">
        <div class="hero-photo-wrap">
          <div class="hero-photo-ring">
            <img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51407211?s=400&v=4" alt="Sunil Shedge">
          </div>
          <div class="float-badge glass b1"><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge" style="color:#3fe0c5"></i>Flutter · Dart</div>
          <div class="float-badge glass b2"><i class="bi bi-shield-check" style="color:#8b6cf2"></i>4+ yrs prod-ready</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag" data-aos="fade-up"><span class="num">01</span>About me</div>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-aos="fade-up">What I bring to the table</h2>
    <p class="section-desc" data-aos="fade-up">Full-cycle mobile engineering — from pixel-perfect Flutter UI to the backend services and CI/CD that keep it shipping.</p>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
        <div class="about-card glass glass-hover">
          <div class="about-icon"><i class="bi bi-phone"></i></div>
          <h5>Cross-platform mobile</h5>
          <p>Flutter/Dart apps for Android, iOS and Web with Clean Architecture, MVVM and SOLID principles.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div class="about-card glass glass-hover">
          <div class="about-icon"><i class="bi bi-server"></i></div>
          <h5>Full-stack backends</h5>
          <p>Node.js, Express and PostgreSQL APIs with JWT auth, RBAC and optimised schema design.</p>
        </div>
